OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies in early morning
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian who was hit by a car while
OL,7,Fwalking to an army site in the early
OL,8,Fhours of the morning has died.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old man was on Stapleton
OL,11,FBank, Cleasby, when the crash happened
OL,12,Fat about 06:15 GMT on Sunday, and was
OL,13,Fbelieved to be walking from Darlington
OL,14,Fto Catterick Garrison, North Yorkshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe force said he was with a friend,
OL,18,Fwho was not injured.
OL,20,FThe crash involved a blue Suzuki Swift
OL,21,Fand the driver is assisting police with
OL,22,Ftheir inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
